<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Fabricato H1 net losses mushroom.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Fabricato H1 net losses mushroom.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's largest textile company Fabricato posted the following first-half results:</p>
<p>	    First-half 1997		 First-half 1996</p>
<p> Net loss 18.6 billion pesos	    Loss 10 billion</p>
<p> Total revenues 87.6 billion	    Revenues 80 billion</p>
<p> Total assets 377.4 billion	     Assets 348.2 billion</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in Colombian pesos and subject to verification by the Securities Superintendency.</p>
<p>((--Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
